    "After yesterday's encounter with Mikko, Kvist's whole body aches..."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:9
translate english day3_start_62fa90ac:

    # "У вас осталось только одно действие на сегодня."
    "You only have one action left today."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:11
translate english day3_start_6342069b:

    # "Ты отлично выспался сегодня."
    "You slept really well today."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:24
translate english day3_start_f00b7c65:

    # "Третий день."
    "Day Three."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:32
