translate english day3_linh_visit_741586bd:

    # l "Жалко, зайду завтра, милок."
    l "That's a shame. I'll stop by tomorrow, dear."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:63
translate english day3_linh_visit_4b782b41:

    # l "Спасибо, дорогой! Ты такой добрый."
    l "Thank you, dear! You're so kind."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:73
translate english day3_linh_visit_4eb31077:

    # "Вам зачислили 15 кредитов"
    "You received 15 credits."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:74
translate english day3_linh_visit_22ec4ff8:

    # l "Ну ладно, держи. Спасибо."
    l "All right then, here you go. Thank you."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:83
translate english day3_linh_visit_4eb31077_1:

    # "Вам зачислили 15 кредитов"
    "You received 15 credits."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:84
translate english day3_linh_visit_00215553:

    # l "Ох, дороговато, но что поделать... Спасибо."
    l "Oh, that's a bit expensive, but what can you do... Thank you."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:87
translate english day3_linh_visit_c9448090:

    # l "Ах, плеер ещё не готов?.. Ну ладно, подожду."
    l "Oh, the player isn't ready yet?.. All right, I'll wait."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:90
translate english day3_linh_visit_86438604:

    # "Линь Чи ушла, Квист сидит и пытается проснуться."
    "Linh Chi leaves, and Kvist sits there trying to wake up."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:96
translate english day3_bekker_visit_a6f6cde7:

    # "Звонок в дверь."
    "The doorbell rings."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:97
translate english day3_bekker_visit_241af4bf:

    # k "Когда я уже его починю."
    k "When am I finally going to fix it?"

# game/events/day_3.rpy:99
translate english day3_bekker_visit_4edc67a0:

    # b "Привет, Квист."
    b "Hey, Kvist."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:101
translate english day3_bekker_visit_dc87fa11:

    # b "Кстати, слышал, ты во второй день с Микко время проводил."
    b "By the way, I heard you spent some time with Mikko on day two."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:102
translate english day3_bekker_visit_19355aab:

    # k "Слухи быстро расходятся."
    k "Rumors spread fast."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:103
translate english day3_bekker_visit_2b9e23d3:

    # b "Especially when someone clears out a warehouse full of biorobotic arms for me. By the way, I'll tell my suppliers not to get too crazy with the prices."
    b "Especially when someone clears out a warehouse full of biorobotic arms for me. By the way, I'll tell my suppliers not to get too crazy with the prices."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:105
translate english day3_bekker_visit_d4e1e0a4:

    # k "Понятно."
    k "Got it."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:109
translate english day3_bekker_visit_318ec54f:

    # "Беккер достаёт из кармана небольшую упаковку и кладёт её на стол."
    "Bekker pulls a small package from his pocket and places it on the table."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:110
translate english day3_bekker_visit_2925f868:

    # b "Твоя микросхема."
    b "Your microchip."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:113
translate english day3_bekker_visit_c2e640d8:

    # "Получена микросхема."
    "Microchip acquired."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:119
translate english day3_bekker_visit_682b92e3:

    # "Беккер достаёт из сумки моток провода и кладёт его на стол."
    "Bekker takes a coil of wire from his bag and places it on the table."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:120
translate english day3_bekker_visit_527719d8:

    # b "Провод, как и договаривались."
    b "The wire, just as promised."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:123
translate english day3_bekker_visit_1ec1f2a0:

    # "Получен провод."
    "Wire acquired."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:129
translate english day3_bekker_visit_703eb815:

    # "Беккер достаёт из кармана микросхему, а из сумки — провод."
    "Bekker takes a microchip from his pocket and a coil of wire from his bag."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:130
translate english day3_bekker_visit_adf6b49f:

    # b "Держи, что просил. И микросхема, и провод."
    b "Here's what you asked for. Both the microchip and the wire."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:134
translate english day3_bekker_visit_7f13b120:

    # "Получены микросхема и провод."
    "Microchip and wire acquired."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:140
translate english day3_bekker_visit_84896886:

    # b "Кстати, модуль самоката готов? У меня вечером куча дел, надо всё успеть."
    b "By the way, is the scooter module ready? I've got a ton of things to do tonight and need to get everywhere in time."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:142
translate english day3_bekker_visit_11fdb519:

    # extend "" nointeract
    extend "" nointeract

# game/events/day_3.rpy:144
translate english day3_bekker_visit_00bfc3c9:

    # b "Ну давай быстрее. У меня много дел. Просто в очередной раз напоминаю про пол."
    b "Then hurry up. I've got a lot to do. Just reminding you about the floor again."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:149
translate english day3_bekker_visit_ee9de572:

    # b "Ты меня спас, папаша. Сделаю тебе скидочку на следующий заказ 2 кредита на деталь, правда всегда поставищи могут офигеть, но все равно лучше, чем ничего"
    b "You saved me, old man. I'll give you a discount on the next order—2 credits off per part. Sure, suppliers can always lose their minds with prices, but it's still better than nothing."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:157
translate english day3_bekker_visit_4eb31077:

    # "Вам зачислили 15 кредитов"
    "You received 15 credits."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:158
translate english day3_bekker_visit_58b488d1:

    # b "Справедливо."
    b "Fair enough."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:165
translate english day3_bekker_visit_86bf3c8f:

    # "Вам зачислили 20 кредитов"
    "You received 20 credits."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:166
translate english day3_bekker_visit_a8292784:

    # b "Начинаю понимать, почему ты дружишь с Микко."
    b "I'm starting to understand why you're friends with Mikko."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:170
translate english day3_bekker_visit_d3e98d1a:

    # b "Кстати, модуль самоката готов?"
    b "By the way, is the scooter module ready?"

# game/events/day_3.rpy:171
translate english day3_bekker_visit_0dea047a:

    # k "А что?"
    k "Why?"

# game/events/day_3.rpy:172
translate english day3_bekker_visit_3803bde0:

    # b "У меня вечером очень важные дела. И без самоката я на них тупо не успею."
    b "I've got something really important tonight. Without the scooter, I simply won't make it in time."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:173
translate english day3_bekker_visit_06d7a03c:

    # b "Так что очень надеюсь услышать хорошие новости... хотя бы сегодня вечером."
    b "So I'm really hoping to hear some good news... at least by this evening."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:177
translate english day3_bekker_visit_cbaffc06:

    # b "Спасибо за модуль самоката. У меня вечером куча дел, должен всё успеть."
    b "Thanks for fixing the scooter module. I've got a lot to do tonight, so I should be able to make it everywhere on time."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:179
translate english day3_bekker_visit_62ed3630:

    # b "Кстати, актуальная цена на следующий заказ [clients['bekker']['base_price']] за запчасть. Пока!"
    b "By the way, the current price for the next order is [clients['bekker']['base_price']] per part. See you!"

# game/events/day_3.rpy:182
translate english day3_bekker_visit_169d25ca:

    # "Беккер уходит."
    "Bekker leaves."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:188
translate english day2_call_pol_286b40c9:

    # p "Квист, привет! Это Пол."
    p "Kvist, hey! It's Paul."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:189
translate english day2_call_pol_694e7edc:

    # p "Слушай, Андрею сбил какой-то придурок, вернее..."
    p "Listen, Andrea got hit by some idiot, or rather..."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:190
translate english day2_call_pol_c835d398:

    # p "Похоже, потеряла управление на моноколесе. А навстречу как раз ехал какой-то пьяный придурок на магнитном самокате"
    p "Looks like she lost control of her monowheel. And at the same time some drunk idiot on a magnetic scooter was coming the other way."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:191
translate english day2_call_pol_c922faa4:

    # p "Он даже затормозить нормально не успел. Я помог ей дойти до Gifts of the Sea, but she needs help urgently."
    p "He didn't even have time to brake properly. I helped her get to Gifts of the Sea, but she urgently needs help."

# game/events/day_3.rpy:192
translate english day2_call_pol_fe1ef22b:

    # p "Надо помочь ей доехать до Нонни. Я бы сделал сам, но меня вызвали в рейд."
    p "She needs help getting to Nonni. I'd do it myself, but I've been called out on a raid."